**Claim supported:** The architecture's dream integration state — in which the conscious
deliberation loop suspends and the subconscious processes its archive autonomously — is
grounded in sleep research establishing that memory consolidation is sleep-dependent
(Stickgold, 2005; Walker & Stickgold, 2004). The specific claim that the dream state
